Package: glmjax
Title: Batched Negative-Binomial GLM Fits Compiled by XLA
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: person("Ben", "Traven", email = "ben.uzh@proton.me", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Fits one negative-binomial (or Poisson) log-link GLM per gene at a given dispersion,
    for count matrices with a shared design. The fitting kernel is written in JAX, shipped as
    portable 'StableHLO' programs, and compiled on the user's machine through 'pjrt'; no Python
    is needed at runtime. Meant as a fast fitter underneath differential-expression packages.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: xlaport
URL: https://github.com/btraven00/glm-jax
